lord|REVIEW: Historical noble/land authority is distinguished from religious use and a capitalized title. The fictional gift of a mill claims no modern peerage law; exact title scope and Vietnamese register remain unresolved.
rid|PASS: Rid a place of an unwanted thing and the related get rid of expression are distinguished. Leaves trapped at a roof are a plausible object; rid/ridded morphology is noted without inventing a new POS.
sunlight|PASS: Solar light is separated from resulting heat. The curtain-gap example is original and quantitative claims are avoided; short generic definition overlap will remain a similarity signal if detected.
writing|PASS: Composition activity and visible handwriting retain separate source ordinals. Comparative time for exhibition labels is not confused with lettering size; uncountable and collected writings usages are separated.
competence|REVIEW: Adequate task performance should not be overstated as full mastery in the Vietnamese gloss. Customer enquiries also need a clearer questions translation; apply two field overlays and re-review the full batch.
